  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Usage",
      "text": "`CloseButton` renders a button with `X` icon inside. It is used in other Mantine components like [Drawer](/core/drawer) or [Modal](/core/modal).",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Change icon",
      "text": "You can change icon by passing any react node to the `icon` prop.\nIt is useful when `CloseButton` is used as a part of other components,\nfor example, in [Drawer](/core/drawer) or [Modal](/core/modal).\nNote that if you use `icon` prop, `iconSize` prop is ignored –\nyou will have to set icon size manually.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accessibility",
      "text": "To make `CloseButton` accessible for screen readers, you need to either set `aria-label` or\nuse [VisuallyHidden](/core/visually-hidden) component:",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
